    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Meetings Meetings Historys-v2-spec",
    "description": "The Meetings History Retrieval API allows organizations to access a comprehensive history of scheduled meetings within their systems. This endpoint provides developers with the ability to retrieve details about past meetings, including participant information, timestamps, and agenda items. Typically used by administrative personnel and data analysts, this API supports use cases such as reporting, compliance audits, and performance reviews. By leveraging this API, businesses can enhance their meeting management and improve operational transparency.",
